    <!-- Medical & Privacy -->
    <string name="medical_disclaimer_title">Medical Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="medical_disclaimer_body">Curalis is a medication reminder and tracking tool; it does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult your doctor or pharmacist before making decisions about your medication. In an emergency, call your local emergency number instead of using this app.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_button">Privacy Policy &amp; Data Protection Notice</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy &amp; Data Protection Notice</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">Curalis stores all the medication, appointment, doctor, and measurement information you enter only in your device\'s local database. This data never leaves your device unless you explicitly start a backup.\n\nMedication search suggestions are read from a local database bundled with the app (the Turkish Ministry of Health TİTCK medication list); no network request is made for these searches.\n\nIf you use the backup feature: local backups are encrypted with a password you choose before being saved to the location you pick. Google Drive backups are encrypted the same way and are uploaded only to your own Google account\'s private, app-only folder; the developer cannot access this data.\n\nThe app contains no ads, analytics/tracking libraries, or third-party data sharing. You are in full control of your data: you can export it at any time from Settings, or delete all local data by uninstalling the app.\n\nYour personal health data is processed and stored only on your own device, under your own control; it is not stored or processed on any server by the developer.</string>

